WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.808
Today we will appreciate work using evidence. Our work connects with international

00:00:04.808 --> 00:00:07.112
artists and communities around the world.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.086
Describe visible lines, colours, textures and shapes.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.043
Say which details help communicate the artist’s idea.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.919
Give one evidence-based compliment and one possible improvement. Justify a revision

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.630
using evidence from another world tradition.
